{
  "text": "On the authority of Abu Hurairah, may Allah be pleased of him, that the messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, let him who believes in Allah and the last day, either speak day, either speak good, or keep silent, and let him who believes in Allah and the last day, be generous to his neighbor, and let him who believes in Allah and the last day, be generous to his guest. It was related by al-Bukhari and Muslim.",
